{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56692","headline":"真真歌 二 · 无名氏","name":"真真歌 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"蛱蝶双飞芍药前，鸳鸯对浴芙蓉水。\n（均见《锦锈万花谷前集》卷十七。\n）（按：郑还古恋沈真真故事，见《侍儿小名录》及《绿窗新话》卷上，《太平广记》卷一六八所载缺名氏。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"无名氏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56692.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56692","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}